            "title_size_m": 24,
            "title_weight": "500",
            "title_mb": 14,
            "body_text": "<p>Keep your jewellery away from perfumes, cosmetics, lotions, household cleaners, and harsh chemicals. Remove your jewellery before swimming, showering, exercising, sleeping, or prolonged contact with water.</p><p>Gently clean your jewellery using a soft, clean cloth to maintain its shine. When not being worn, store each piece separately in a soft pouch or jewellery box to help prevent scratches, tangling, and accidental damage.</p><p>Always handle fine jewellery with care and avoid excessive pressure, pulling, bending, or contact with hard surfaces.</p>",
