            "body_text": "<p>YAZ & Co jewellery is covered against verified manufacturing defects in materials and workmanship for the applicable warranty period stated at the time of purchase.</p><p>Our warranty may cover manufacturing-related faults involving the construction, setting, clasps, prongs, or other components of the jewellery. All warranty claims are subject to inspection and approval by YAZ & Co.</p><p>If a manufacturing defect is confirmed, YAZ & Co will determine the appropriate resolution, which may include repair or replacement.</p>",
