            "body_text": "<p>Our warranty does not cover normal wear and tear, scratches, accidental damage, improper handling, loss or theft, exposure to water, perfumes, cosmetics or chemicals, or damage resulting from failure to follow our Jewellery Care recommendations.</p><p>The warranty may also become void if the jewellery has been resized, repaired, altered, or modified by a third party without prior approval from YAZ & Co.</p><p>To request a warranty assessment, please contact YAZ & Co with your order details or proof of purchase, clear photographs of the jewellery, and a brief description of the issue. Our team will review your request and advise you on the next steps.</p>",
